@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Repeatable Isolated Setup and Evidence
start
:Confirm selected stack, work item and actual target paths;
:Record effective compatible tools / required extensions;
:Resolve and lock dependencies for both applications;
:Provision separate keys, sessions, databases and private roots;
:Verify safe test targets before migrations / fixtures;
:Run actual isolated install, migration, build and basic checks;
:Verify receiving entry, owner-local jobs and required facilities;
if (Clean setup repeatable with evidence?) then (yes)
 :Record actual commands, versions, revision and results;
else (no)
 :Record failed prerequisite / blocker and corrective work;
endif
:Review outcome without claiming dependent gates passed;
stop
@enduml
